# RockCore .gitattributes
# 统一换行符 + 标注二进制文件，避免跨平台污染与无意义 diff

# ---- 文本文件：仓库内统一 LF ----
* text=auto
*.md        text
*.json      text
*.yml       text
*.yaml      text
*.txt       text
*.ts        text
*.tsx       text
*.mjs       text
*.css       text
*.html      text
*.rs        text
*.toml      text
*.conf      text
.gitignore  text
.gitattributes text
LICENSE     text

# ---- 二进制文件：不做换行转换 ----
# xlsx 是「导入模板」交付物（嵌入安装包），换行转换会直接损坏文件
*.xlsx    binary
*.ico     binary
*.icns    binary
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.jpeg    binary
*.gif     binary
*.woff    binary
*.woff2   binary
*.ttf     binary
*.db      binary
*.sqlite  binary

# ---- 文档中的规范参考图（保持二进制，不做 diff）----
docs/*.png binary
